{"unit_id":"MythGreenLand__dsh-local-delegate#feature-1","repo":"MythGreenLand/dsh-local-delegate","commit":"bbe48828e76032343adaf590538e6617f8f66272","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-delegate 的功能「单文件文本变换」：对文件或短文本执行翻译、摘要、抽取、分类、改写、提交说明或命名；由 local_transform 调用，文件模式写出结果文件并返回简短回执。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1147-1197","index.js:367-423"]}
{"unit_id":"MythGreenLand__dsh-local-delegate#feature-2","repo":"MythGreenLand/dsh-local-delegate","commit":"bbe48828e76032343adaf590538e6617f8f66272","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-delegate 的功能「批量处理文件」：local_batch 可对多个文件执行文本变换，默认只返回 dry-run 计划；设置 dry_run=false 后生成输出文件，并逐项汇报处理结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1198-1230","index.js:579-688"]}
{"unit_id":"MythGreenLand__dsh-local-delegate#feature-3","repo":"MythGreenLand/dsh-local-delegate","commit":"bbe48828e76032343adaf590538e6617f8f66272","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-delegate 的功能「工作区委派等级」：为工作区选择 none、light、default、high 或 max；策略按会话所属工作区应用，并在较高等级下提供 local_worker 子代理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/levels.js:20-27","lib/levels.js:140-185","lib/policy.js:256-290","lib/worker-tool.js:65-110"]}
{"unit_id":"MythGreenLand__dsh-local-delegate#feature-4","repo":"MythGreenLand/dsh-local-delegate","commit":"bbe48828e76032343adaf590538e6617f8f66272","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-delegate 的功能「并行从代理」：启用后 root 或 Team Lead 可用 slave_team_spawn 将独立任务分派给多个模型路由上的子代理，再查询状态、等待、发送后续消息或中断。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/slaves.js:1-31","lib/slaves.js:944-990","index.js:1087-1088"]}
{"unit_id":"MythGreenLand__dsh-local-delegate#feature-5","repo":"MythGreenLand/dsh-local-delegate","commit":"bbe48828e76032343adaf590538e6617f8f66272","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-delegate 的功能「端点诊断」：调用 local_health 探测主端点与备用端点、检查模型是否可用并给出修复信息；也可用 /localdoctor 查看诊断，/localstats 查看用量。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1232-1243","index.js:1271-1275","index.js:1260-1268"]}
{"unit_id":"MythGreenLand__dsh-local-delegate#caveat-1","repo":"MythGreenLand/dsh-local-delegate","commit":"bbe48828e76032343adaf590538e6617f8f66272","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-delegate 使用前须知：转换内容会通过 HTTP 请求发送到当前配置的模型端点；默认是本机 Ollama，改用远程端点时该服务会收到文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/endpoint.js:117-144","cordis.patch.yml:18-25"]}
